{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1000_p", "source_sha256": "49fdfbe04509498c996b6850e08844f0d24b947ca86a02bedc712c713285fb7f", "ja": "（今日は、美奈子のプライベートブランドの\n宣伝を兼ねたファンタジーのミニドラマを撮影した）", "zh": "（今天拍摄了一部奇幻迷你剧，同时也为美奈子的私人品牌做宣传。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "49cde5c32ace86c32c9b2e679c0461506b885524516ee3248bf24bcebbddaed7", "ja": "{$P$}さん、見ててくれました？\n私の妖艶なお芝居、どうでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您有在看吗？\n我那妖艳的演技，觉得怎么样呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1002_p", "source_sha256": "162b027e2a0659a278156f5707cdbe73bd827e1e704280a347222044446f173f", "ja": "お疲れ様、美奈子。\nすごく雰囲気があって、引き込まれる感じがしたな。", "zh": "辛苦了，美奈子。\n特别有氛围感，让人不知不觉就沉浸进去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1003_p", "source_sha256": "03ff5bfed4819296cada01eacead309df0f4a940828dca83f5fc23b27b0ef2fc", "ja": "『怪しげな商品を取り扱う店の店主』なんて\n難しい役なのに。バッチリだったよ！", "zh": "明明是“经营着可疑商品的店主”这种很难演的角色，你却演得特别棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "5e45bc094edd647f61a4612e15cc466c8f7c72bcd95daba5834942d1990778dc", "ja": "わっほーい！　役作り、頑張った甲斐がありました！\n最初は、ちょっとだけ苦戦したんですけど……。", "zh": "哇——！努力塑造角色总算有回报了！\n虽然一开始确实稍微遇到了点困难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "ec08f3e0edabd341a81889cd834ccba1aa062648fba8a38b285521abb5c694ab", "ja": "せっかく、この服を見てもらえる機会ですからね。\nやる気特盛りで、準備してきました！", "zh": "难得有机会让大家看看这身衣服嘛。\n我可是干劲十足地准备好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "80bc86e7d64fd197327093a2e7f4d11a7c8f152a4acb61a977f117dbf453802c", "ja": "{$P$}さんの言葉で\n報われた気がして……とっても嬉しいです♪", "zh": "听到{$P$}先生这么说，\n感觉一切都值了……真的好开心哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1007_p", "source_sha256": "50b85ec240df412b50cd7029df7784a6e19cb222d3dcfb190ebc07c07d0972ba", "ja": "それはよかった。\n美奈子のおかげで、服のアピールは十分できたよ。", "zh": "那就太好了。\n多亏了美奈子，服装的宣传效果已经很充分了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3ecff46b6161d7fcfa28665a4eb25531e4e3a97b7798ddf079802197ef06a9a7", "ja": "でも、意外だったのは、メガネが\n店主の怪しい雰囲気に一役買うとは思わなかったよ。", "zh": "不过，没想到眼镜居然也为店主那股可疑的气质增色不少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "17e29bc5794dd238373ad1557004ae275b44c8fc6eb339cc98a9663420a62a73", "ja": "そうですね。メガネもこだわった部分ですけど、\nまさか、こういう役にも合うなんて……。", "zh": "是啊。眼镜也是我特别讲究的地方，没想到居然连这种角色都很合适……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9636a62a8171da6814cb48ce4856b34b7f13df20fe43bf1368676e8c5c216e50", "ja": "ああ、本当に不思議だ。お店にやってくるお客さん\nみたいに、何かに導かれたのかもしれないな。", "zh": "啊，确实很不可思议。也许就像来到店里的客人一样，是被什么引导到这里来的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "ce6e7e4e5ed9b25babaf912d8cae54de62b4821cb3a210918a3d5e3723750ccc", "ja": "導かれて……。この店主さん、\nいつも誰かのために、お店で待ってるんですよね。", "zh": "被指引而来……这位店主，\n总是在店里为了某个人而等待着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "7d6e4d3b4b24e6e5c30b390358219b25bdbb580e0ccbe0d2cfbbe8b102f72daf", "ja": "なんだか、私と似てる気がしませんか？", "zh": "总觉得，和我有点像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1013_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "698d0a90eba25351824aec00f5ac87c5dba81d6e8cd374b02fdd2398b995495f", "ja": "お客さんの本当に欲しいものを提供する……\n接客業では、一番大事なことですから♪", "zh": "提供客人真正想要的东西……\n因为这是待客行业最重要的事♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1015_p", "source_sha256": "62abd21f4e46fa4a997526ab677cf9df42b4e20dab08966accca2f5a5aae72f0", "ja": "言われてみれば、たしかに……。\nははっ。この配役も、店主の導きだったり……なんて。", "zh": "你这么说，确实……。\n哈哈。这次的角色分配，说不定也是店主的引导……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "3650ec1f846bf8dc8d817dfa82b8296711451d17324555622a1b6f08c0f11478", "ja": "ふっふっふ……\nそれじゃあ、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "呵呵呵……\n那么，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "776af9196c6004990365c0e8febc97b4a9819d4063cb6def07b1cbc8d5e53da2", "ja": "「今、あなたはなにを欲しているの？\nさあ、教えて。どんなモノで満たされたいのかしら？」", "zh": "「现在，你渴望着什么呢？\n来，告诉我吧。想被什么样的东西填满呢？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1018_p", "source_sha256": "25c8869991fff05498c4517de24db1f74509a99289070fc6748f50b67120e742", "ja": "そうだなぁ、ありきたりな答えだけど……。\n食事かな。さっきから空腹で……。", "zh": "这么说吧，虽然答案很普通……  \n我想吃东西。刚才开始就一直饿着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "67149569c1c6308ebfb5ba96559d24777a4963a414e2c3f11197feb7333df099", "ja": "ふふっ、そう言ってくると思って、\n今日もいーっぱい、差し入れを用意してきました！", "zh": "呵呵，我就猜到你会这么说，\n所以今天也准备了满满的慰问品！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0544_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "baa4e3c02b26be14447e0560c59d05049df5d8775082d07fd430fde3a8e3a55c", "ja": "{$P$}さんの貪欲なお腹も心も、\n私がぜーんぶ満たしてあげちゃいますね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生那贪婪的肚子和心灵，\n都统～统交给我来填满吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
